-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mindfulness Meditation<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1274bf7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1274bf7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mindfulness can improve health and wellbeing by helping you learn to pay attention to your own thoughts and feelings in the present moment. <\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mindfulness is suitable for anyone but can be particularly beneficial for those living with stress, anxiety, depression, pain or illness.\u00a0 <\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Research has shown that incorporating Mindfulness into a busy lifestyle can lead to improved health and wellbeing.<\/span><\/p><p><b><i>\u201cMy racing mind \u2018must do\u2019, \u2018didn\u2019t do\u2019 etc. has slowed down considerably\u201d<\/i><\/b><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/theaislingcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/AislingCentre_Leaflet_MindfulMeditation.pdf\"><b><i>Mindfulness Meditation Information Leaflet<\/i><\/b><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/theaislingcentre.com\/workshops-programmes\/\"><b><i>Upcoming Mindfulness events<\/i><\/b><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b45f76e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b45f76e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/theaislingcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/IMG_0035-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2388\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http